Subject: [PATCH 15/16] Fix printf type warnings.

Signed-off-by: Jaco Kroon <jaco@uls.co.za>
---
 ipt_NETFLOW.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ipt_NETFLOW.c b/ipt_NETFLOW.c
index 8314000..2504fbc 100644
